[{"answer":"What do you see when you go to the grocery store?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/1.mp3"},{"answer":"The aisles are filled with food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/2.mp3"},{"answer":"There are also refrigerators and freezers filled with food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/3.mp3"},{"answer":"There are sometimes things in bins in the middle of the aisles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/4.mp3"},{"answer":"There are different departments in the grocery store.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/5.mp3"},{"answer":"There is the bakery.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/6.mp3"},{"answer":"In the bakery, there are sweet things such as cakes, pies, cookies and tarts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/7.mp3"},{"answer":"There are also things that you would eat with your dinner like bread and buns.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/8.mp3"},{"answer":"There are other things in the bakery department like bagels and biscuits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/9.mp3"},{"answer":"The baker works in the bakery.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/10.mp3"},{"answer":"There is the canned goods section.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/11.mp3"},{"answer":"This is where you might find sauces and soups.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Vegetables and fruits also come in cans.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/13.mp3"},{"answer":"There is the section for dairy products.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Here you would find milk and cream.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/15.mp3"},{"answer":"The dairy section would also have cheese and butter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yogurt is also found in the dairy section.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/17.mp3"},{"answer":"In the meat department, there is beef and pork.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Poultry is also found in the meat department.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Poultry is chicken, duck and goose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/20.mp3"},{"answer":"There are also cold cuts in the meat department.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Cold cuts are the meats that are sliced up for sandwiches.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Some examples of cold cuts are ham and baloney.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/23.mp3"},{"answer":"The butcher works in the meat department.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/24.mp3"},{"answer":"The produce department is full of fruits and vegetables.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Clerks spray water on the fruits and vegetables to keep them fresh.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/26.mp3"},{"answer":"There is a section in the grocery store for personal hygiene.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/27.mp3"},{"answer":"This is where you would find shampoo and toothpaste.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Soap and skin products would also be in this section.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/29.mp3"},{"answer":"There is even a section for your pets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/30.mp3"},{"answer":"You can buy cat food and dog food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/31.mp3"},{"answer":"There are toys for cats and dogs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/53-grocery-shopping-2019-03-29-10-21-36/32.mp3"}]
